{"title": "Radiating Shockwave", "pageid": 30398, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Radiating_Shockwave", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Radiating Shockwave</b> is a passive feature that causes small explosions when dealing radiant damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When the wearer deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> damage, they cause a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant_Shockwave\" title=\"Radiant Shockwave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Generic_Radiant_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Radiant_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Generic_Radiant_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Radiant_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Generic_Radiant_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Radiant_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant Shockwave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Generic_Radiant_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Radiant_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Generic_Radiant_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Radiant_Shockwave\" title=\"Radiant Shockwave\">Radiant Shockwave</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luminous_Armour\" title=\"Luminous Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Luminous_Armour\" title=\"Luminous Armour\">Luminous Armour</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Radiating Shockwave does not work with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonbeam\" title=\"Moonbeam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/20px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/30px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/40px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonbeam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/20px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonbeam\" title=\"Moonbeam\">Moonbeam</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205431\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1539/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11795/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3713/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 937108/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.487      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   38.487      1 -total\n 31.77%   12.227      3 Template:Icon_link\n 30.60%   11.779      3 Template:Icon_text\n 28.76%   11.068     15 Template:Trim\n 25.99%   10.001      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 25.07%    9.647      1 Template:DamageType\n 20.65%    7.948      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 20.31%    7.817      5 Template:Ifempty\n 18.32%    7.050      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30398-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714205431 and revision id 383251. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}